&lt;li&gt;Speed. You work quickly to generate ideas and know how to decide which things can ship now and what things need time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus. We’re a high-growth startup with a busy, remote team. You know how and when to engage or be heads down&lt;/li&gt;
